@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Health Check
# Checks database connectivity and service readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Generate Mock JWT Auth Token
# Returns a valid JWT token for testing protected endpoints
# @name auth
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token?customerId=CUST-CHIDI-001
Accept: {{contentType}}

### Extract Token from response (in VS Code REST Client / Visual Studio)
@authToken = {{auth.response.body.token}}

###

### 3. Create Wallet for Chidi (Source Wallet)
# @name createChidiWallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerId": "CUST-CHIDI",
  "currency": "NGN"
}

###

### 4. Create Wallet for Amaka (Destination Wallet)
# @name createAmakaWallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerId": "CUST-AMAKA",
  "currency": "NGN"
}

### Store Wallet IDs
@chidiWalletId = {{createChidiWallet.response.body.id}}
@amakaWalletId = {{createAmakaWallet.response.body.id}}

###

### 5. Get Chidi's Wallet Balance (Initial ₦0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{chidiWalletId}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 6. Credit Chidi's Wallet (Simulating Inbound NIP Transfer)
# Amount: ₦50,000 = 5,000,000 kobo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{chidiWalletId}}/credit
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "amountKobo": 5000000,
  "narration": "Inbound NIP transfer - Salary",
  "reference": "NIP-DEP-001"
}

###

### 7. Transfer Funds from Chidi to Amaka (₦15,000 = 1,500,000 kobo)
# Idempotent Transfer: Uses unique Idempotency-Key
# @name initialTransfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{chidiWalletId}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Idempotency-Key: chidi-to-amaka-tx-001
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "destinationWalletId": "{{amakaWalletId}}",
  "amountKobo": 1500000,
  "narration": "Transfer to Amaka for groceries",
  "reference": "TXN-REF-001"
}

###

### 8. Idempotency Test: Replay Identical Request (Network Retry Simulation)
# Same Key + Same Payload -> Returns cached response with X-Cache: HIT (Zero duplicate deduction)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{chidiWalletId}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Idempotency-Key: chidi-to-amaka-tx-001
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "destinationWalletId": "{{amakaWalletId}}",
  "amountKobo": 1500000,
  "narration": "Transfer to Amaka for groceries",
  "reference": "TXN-REF-001"
}

###

### 9. Idempotency Test: Tampered Payload Replay (Malicious / Conflict Simulation)
# Same Key + Changed Amount -> Returns HTTP 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{chidiWalletId}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Idempotency-Key: chidi-to-amaka-tx-001
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "destinationWalletId": "{{amakaWalletId}}",
  "amountKobo": 3000000,
  "narration": "Tampered transfer attempt"
}

###

### 10. Get Chidi's Balance After Transfer (Should be ₦35,000 = 3,500,000 kobo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{chidiWalletId}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 11. Get Amaka's Balance After Transfer (Should be ₦15,000 = 1,500,000 kobo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{amakaWalletId}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 12. Get Chidi's Paginated Account Statement (Newest First)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{chidiWalletId}}/statement?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 13. Edge Case: Validation Error (Negative Amount -> RFC 7807 Problem Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{chidiWalletId}}/credit
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "amountKobo": -50000,
  "narration": "Invalid negative credit test"
}

###

### 14. Edge Case: Insufficient Funds (Attempting to transfer ₦100,000 with ₦35,000 balance)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{chidiWalletId}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Idempotency-Key: overdraft-test-key-001
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "destinationWalletId": "{{amakaWalletId}}",
  "amountKobo": 10000000,
  "narration": "Overdraft attempt"
}
